EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
       The following code loops over the tokens contained in a wide‐character
       string.

       wchar_t *wcs = ...;
       wchar_t *token;
       wchar_t *state;
       for (token = wcstok(wcs, L" \t\n", &state);
           token != NULL;
           token = wcstok(NULL, L" \t\n", &state)) {
           ...
       }

